d.',2),(5723,2251,'C','It allows different cultural groups to sing in harmony.',3),(5724,2251,'D','It is the only language favored by all peoples of the world.',4),(5725,2252,'A','Their musical experience can be compared.',1),(5726,2252,'B','A novel language can be created.',2),(5727,2252,'C','Their unique skills can be displayed.',3),(5728,2252,'D','Fantastic results can be achieved.',4),(5729,2253,'A','It is present in music all around the world.',1),(5730,2253,'B','It is helpful to understanding music.',2),(5731,2253,'C','It is the basis for musicians\'creation.',3),(5732,2253,'D','It is a medium for ordinary people to relate.',4),(5733,2254,'A','To bring them together.',1),(5734,2254,'B','To show their identity.',2),(5735,2254,'C','To express their emotions.',3),(5736,2254,'D','To keep them entertained.',4),(5737,2255,'A','The way people respond to it.',1),(5738,2255,'B','The role it plays in society',2),(5739,2255,'C','The joy it brings to people.',3),(5740,2255,'D','The way it is made use of.',4),(5741,2256,'A','He had bought meals with his online food ordering account.',1),(5742,2256,'B','His son had used his cell phone to pay for playing a game.',2),(5743,2256,'C','His son had ordered food from several restaurants.',3),(5744,2256,'D','He had dined out at a famous five-star restaurant.',4),(5745,2257,'A','Teach his son a lesson.',1),(5746,2257,'B','Change his password.',2),(5747,2257,'C','Ask his neighbors for help.',3),(5748,2257,'D','Buy a bigger refrigerator.',4),(5749,2258,'A','They examined how visitors affected animal behaviour in zoos.',1),(5750,2258,'B','They studied when the best time to feed animals in public was.',2),(5751,2258,'C','They studied how animals adapted themselves to life in zoos.',3),(5752,2258,'D','They examined what behaviours indicated animal boredom.',4),(5753,2259,'A','They socialise with zookeepers as well as with each other.',1),(5754,2259,'B','They show good adaptability to living with humans.',2),(5755,2259,'C','They have been kept as pets by humans.',3),(5756,2259,'D','They have been born and raised in zoos.',4),(5757,2260,'A','Adjusting it.',1),(5758,2260,'B','Suspending it.',2),(5759,2260,'C','Reevaluating it.',3),(5760,2260,'D','Expanding it.',4),(5761,2261,'A','They could buy an electric bike for $400 in April.',1),(5762,2261,'B','They could buy their first electric bike at a discount.',2),(5763,2261,'C','They could enjoy free after-sale service for their purchase.',3),(5764,2261,'D','They could get $1,200 from government funds if they qualified.',4),(5765,2262,'A','Put 400 more electric bikes on its streets.',1),(5766,2262,'B','Increase the program funding by 8 percent.',2),(5767,2262,'C','Resume its electric bike incentive program.',3),(5768,2262,'D','Invest millions of dollars into the local economy.',4),(5769,2263,'A','The coin collection.',1),(5770,2263,'B','The primitive tools.',2),(5771,2263,'C','The ancient ornaments.',3),(5772,2263,'D','The 2,000-year-old clothes.',4),(5773,2264,'A','It is charming with narrow but beautiful streets.',1),(5774,2264,'B','It attracts visitors from every corner of the world.',2),(5775,2264,'C','It has flowers displayed around the Trevi Fountain.',3),(5776,2264,'D','It is more attractive than the pictures in guidebooks.',4),(5777,2265,'A','It is covered with wild grass.',1),(5778,2265,'B','It is very famous and pretty.',2),(5779,2265,'C','It is located away from an old church.',3),(5780,2265,'D','It is surrounded by Spanish-style houses.',4),(5781,2266,'A','Ask Kathy what her plan is.',1),(5782,2266,'B','Tell Kathy Mike will join them.',2),(5783,2266,'C','Ask Kathy if she\'d like to see the square.',3),(5784,2266,'D','Tell Kathy Mike would like to have a change.',4),(5785,2267,'A','How to fit into the bigger picture.',1),(5786,2267,'B','How to get on with colleagues.',2),(5787,2267,'C','How to create a solid first impression.',3),(5788,2267,'D','How to succeed in a new job.',4),(5789,2268,'A','Get familiar with all the details of his job descrip